# Generated outputs
generated/*

# Integrity reviews and their resolutions are governance records, not build
# output. They must be version-controlled: a review that cannot see which
# findings were already resolved re-raises them, which is how INT-004 was
# reported by three consecutive reviews.
# (generated/* rather than generated/ — git will not descend into an excluded
# directory, so a negation cannot re-include from one.)
!generated/reviews/

AI_CONTEXT/*
!AI_CONTEXT/README.md
!AI_CONTEXT/INDEX.md
